# Single Node PyTorch Training (Kathara)
## 1. Dataset Setup (Host PC)

Download the FashionMNIST dataset locally before starting the lab (the container has no internet access):

Save the downloaded files inside the shared folder:
shared/data/FashionMNIST/raw/

Make sure Train.py uses the absolute path to load the data:
root="/shared/data"

---

## 2. Start the Lab Environment

From the host command prompt (inside lab-pytorch-one-computer):

kathara lstart

---

## 3. Run Training

Open the pc1 terminal and run:

python3 /shared/Train.py

The model trains locally on CPU and prints the loss and evaluation metrics.

---

## 4. Stop the Lab

When training finishes, shut down the container from the host terminal:

kathara lclean
